title: Status
new-page: true
is-special: true
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.updateReich(Q);
window.RF.numbers(Q);
!}

= Status

[+ month : month +] [+ year +]

Resources: [+ funds +]

{!<span class="col-kpd">KPD</span>!} position: [+ kpd_position +]

Internal dissent: [+ party_dissent : rf_party_dissent +][+ n_party_dissent +]

= Government

Government: [+ government +]

President: [+ president +]

Chancellor: [+ chancellor +]

[? if emergency != "" : **[+ emergency +]** ?]

Reichstag, share of seats (elected June 1920):

{!<div id="rf-reichstag"></div>!}

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Reichstag elected in June 1920 sits for four years, unless it is dissolved sooner.">Next election</span>!}: [+ next_election +]

@party
title: Inside the Party
new-page: true
is-special: true
on-arrival: {!
var RF = window.RF;
Q.overrule_risk = Math.round(100 * RF.overruleChance(Q));
RF.moscowStatus(Q);
Q.next_congress = RF.nextCongressText(Q);
RF.numbers(Q);
!}

= Inside the KPD

Leadership: <span class="f-[+ leader +]">[+ leader_name +]</span>

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The leadership only changes at a party congress, where the delegates elect a new Zentrale. The statutes call for a congress about once a year, and Moscow may try to overturn the delegates' choice.">Next party congress</span>!}: [+ next_congress +]

[? if right_formed = 1 and right_expelled = 0 : {!<div class="rf-faction">!}<span class="f-right">Brandler Right</span>{!<div class="rf-stat">!}Strength: [+ right_strength : strength +][+ n_right_strength +]{!</div><div class="rf-stat">!}Dissent: [+ right_dissent : rf_dissent +][+ n_right_dissent +]{!</div>!}{!<div class="rf-bar"><span class="b-right" style="width: !}[+ right_strength +]{!%"></span></div></div>!} ?][? if right_formed = 1 and right_expelled = 1 : <span class="f-right">Brandler Right</span>: left the party ?]

[? if center_formed = 1 and center_expelled = 0 : {!<div class="rf-faction">!}<span class="f-center">Middle Group</span>{!<div class="rf-stat">!}Strength: [+ center_strength : strength +][+ n_center_strength +]{!</div><div class="rf-stat">!}Dissent: [+ center_dissent : rf_dissent +][+ n_center_dissent +]{!</div>!}{!<div class="rf-bar"><span class="b-center" style="width: !}[+ center_strength +]{!%"></span></div></div>!} ?][? if center_formed = 1 and center_expelled = 1 : <span class="f-center">Middle Group</span>: left the party ?]

[? if left_formed = 1 and left_expelled = 0 : {!<div class="rf-faction">!}<span class="f-left">Fischer–Maslow Left</span>{!<div class="rf-stat">!}Strength: [+ left_strength : strength +][+ n_left_strength +]{!</div><div class="rf-stat">!}Dissent: [+ left_dissent : rf_dissent +][+ n_left_dissent +]{!</div>!}{!<div class="rf-bar"><span class="b-left" style="width: !}[+ left_strength +]{!%"></span></div></div>!} ?][? if left_formed = 1 and left_expelled = 1 : <span class="f-left">Fischer–Maslow Left</span>: left the party ?]

[? if ultra_formed = 1 and ultra_expelled = 0 : {!<div class="rf-faction">!}<span class="f-ultra">Ultra-Left</span>{!<div class="rf-stat">!}Strength: [+ ultra_strength : strength +][+ n_ultra_strength +]{!</div><div class="rf-stat">!}Dissent: [+ ultra_dissent : rf_dissent +][+ n_ultra_dissent +]{!</div>!}{!<div class="rf-bar"><span class="b-ultra" style="width: !}[+ ultra_strength +]{!%"></span></div></div>!} ?][? if ultra_formed = 1 and ultra_expelled = 1 : <span class="f-ultra">Ultra-Left</span>: left the party ?]

[? if stalin_formed = 1 and stalin_expelled = 0 : {!<div class="rf-faction">!}<span class="f-stalin">Thälmann circle</span>{!<div class="rf-stat">!}Strength: [+ stalin_strength : strength +][+ n_stalin_strength +]{!</div><div class="rf-stat">!}Dissent: [+ stalin_dissent : rf_dissent +][+ n_stalin_dissent +]{!</div>!}{!<div class="rf-bar"><span class="b-stalin" style="width: !}[+ stalin_strength +]{!%"></span></div></div>!} ?][? if stalin_formed = 1 and stalin_expelled = 1 : <span class="f-stalin">Thälmann circle</span>: left the party ?]

[? if minor_formed = 1 : {!<div class="rf-faction">!}<span class="f-minor">Minor currents</span>{!<div class="rf-stat">!}Strength: [+ minor_strength : strength +][+ n_minor_strength +]{!</div><div class="rf-stat">!}Dissent: [+ minor_dissent : rf_dissent +][+ n_minor_dissent +]{!</div>!}{!<div class="rf-bar"><span class="b-minor" style="width: !}[+ minor_strength +]{!%"></span></div></div>!} ?]

= Politics

{!<div id="rf-relations"></div>!}

@polls
title: Polls
new-page: true
is-special: true

= Projected election results

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="There were no opinion polls in Weimar Germany. This is the game's estimate of a Reichstag election held now.">If the election were held now</span>!}:

{!<div id="rf-polls"></div>!}

= Results by group

Each group's parties are listed from strongest to weakest.

{!<div id="rf-demographics"></div>!}

@moscow
title: Moscow
new-page: true
is-special: true
on-arrival: {!
var RF = window.RF;
Q.overrule_risk = Math.round(100 * RF.overruleChance(Q));
RF.moscowStatus(Q);
RF.numbers(Q);
!}

= Moscow

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Comintern's strategy for Germany, set at each plenum in Moscow. Factions that fit the line gain standing there.">Comintern line</span>!}: [? if line == "united_front" : united front with the SPD's workers ?][? if line == "insurrection" : prepare the insurrection ?][? if line == "bolshevization" : Bolshevization of the party ?][? if line == "class_against_class" : class against class ?]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="What the last plenum asked of the KPD. The next plenum judges the leadership on it: success wins Moscow's favour, failure brings a rebuke.">Directive</span>!}: [+ directive +] [? if directive_on_track = 1 : (on track) ?][? if directive_on_track = 0 : (behind) ?]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The plenums of the Comintern's Executive Committee and the World Congresses, where the line is set.">Next plenum</span>!}: [+ next_plenum +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="How far the KPD still decides for itself. Each intervention from Moscow wears it down, and the lower it is, the easier Moscow overturns a congress.">Party autonomy</span>!}: [+ autonomy : rf_autonomy +][+ n_autonomy +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="How hard Moscow is pushing to replace the leadership with its favourite. It grows with the gap between them and as autonomy falls. At its peak, Moscow will demand that the next congress installs its favourite. The delegates can refuse if the leadership is strong and the party still runs its own affairs, but Moscow does not forget.">Moscow's pressure</span>!}: [+ overrule_risk : rf_overrule +][+ n_overrule_risk +]

[? if moscow_news != "" : *[+ moscow_news +]* ?]

[? if open_letter = 1 : **Moscow has condemned the leadership in an Open Letter and demands a special congress to replace it.** ?][? if open_letter = 0 and moscow_rebukes = 1 : **Moscow has rebuked the leadership once. A second rebuke brings an Open Letter.** ?]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Russian leaders who decide the Comintern's course. Each KPD faction leans on one of them and rises or falls with its patron; hover over a name to see whom they back.">The Kremlin</span>!}:

{!<div id="rf-kremlin"></div>!}

Moscow favours: <span class="f-[+ favourite +]">[+ favourite_name +]</span>

[? if congress_news != "" : *Last congress: [+ congress_news +]* ?]

@forces
title: Balance of Forces
new-page: true
is-special: true
on-arrival: {!
var RF = window.RF;
var base = RF.risingBase(Q);
Q.rising_chance = Math.round(100 * Math.max(0, Math.min(1, (base + 30 - 140) / 30)));
Q.rev_support = RF.revSupport(Q);
RF.numbers(Q);
!}

#The armed formations are drawn by RF.renderForces (rote_fahne.js):
#strength as words, details in the hover cards, never head counts.

= The armed power of the state

{!<div id="rf-state-forces"></div>!}

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Police and courts acting against the party: bans, raids, arrests.">State repression</span>!}: [+ repression : rf_level +][+ n_repression +]

[? if emergency != "" : **[+ emergency +]** ?]

= Paramilitaries

{!<div id="rf-paramilitaries"></div>!}

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Weapons, training and plans for an armed rising.">The party's armed readiness</span>!}: [+ readiness : rf_level +][+ n_readiness +]

= The mood of the people

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="How many Germans back the democratic Republic. Hyperinflation drains it; stability restores it.">Support for the Republic</span>!}: [+ pro_republic : rf_level +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Nationalist feeling. The Ruhr occupation feeds it, and it feeds the DNVP and the völkisch right.">Support for nationalism</span>!}: [+ nationalism : rf_level +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="How far the people, above all the workers, would back a revolution: the revolutionary situation, the party's vote, the unions and the SPD's workers, against support for the Republic and repression. A rough guide, not a verdict: it counts for a little in the chance of a rising, while plans, allies and arms count for more.">Support for revolution</span>!}: [+ rev_support : rf_revsupport +][+ n_rev_support +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Hunger, strikes and anger at the Republic. It rises with inflation and falls once the currency is stable.">Revolutionary situation</span>!}: [+ rev_situation : rf_rev +][+ n_rev_situation +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Communist strength in the trade unions and factory councils.">Influence in the unions</span>!}: [+ union_influence : rf_level +][+ n_union_influence +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Whether SPD workers would follow a call to arms. Good relations with the SPD count for a lot.">SPD workers</span>!}: [? if spd_relation >= 60 : might follow ?][? if spd_relation < 60 and spd_relation >= 35 : wary ?][? if spd_relation < 35 : would not follow ?][+ n_spd_relation +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Readiness, the revolutionary situation, support for revolution, the unions, the SPD's workers and state repression, against a Reichswehr and police far stronger than the party.">Chance of a rising</span>!}: [+ rising_chance : rf_odds +][+ n_rising_chance +]

@missions
title: Missions
new-page: true
is-special: true

= Missions of the <span class="f-[+ leader +]">[+ leader_name +]</span>

What the faction in the Zentrale wants to achieve. The missions change when another faction takes over.

{!<div id="rf-missions"></div>!}
